<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!-- Settings. Authored rather than borrowed: a ring plus eight teeth placed by
     rotating one tooth around the centre, which keeps every tooth identical and
     the whole form obviously geometric. The ring is an even-odd donut so the
     hole stays crisp when the icon is tinted. -->
